<title>UK: Credit Local de France sets 400 mln DKK Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Credit Local de France sets 400 mln DKK Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banque Internationale a Luxembourg and</p>
<p>Credit Communal/Gemeentekredit.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CREDIT LOCAL DE FRANCE</p>
<p> AMT    400 MLN DKK   COUPON     5.75	MATURITY    12.DEC.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.93    PAY DATE    12.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AA+   DENOMS (K) 10-50     SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
